ultiple capital ships, frigates and a space station to fight for, all with complete interiors<br>\u25cf three optional <strong>singleplayer missions</strong> serving as an introduction to the game<br>\u25cf <strong>navigate</strong> your ship, manage its energy distribution and make use of a variety of different weapons options<br>\u25cf enter one of the <strong>smaller fighters</strong> located in your ships hangars and tip the scales in your favor<br>\u25cf <strong>board the enemy ship</strong>, sabotage important parts like the generator or engine and fight its crew<br>\u25cf lots of<strong> different turret and fighter classes</strong> to customize your ship<br>\u25cf a huge amount of <strong>selectable upgrades</strong> like droids or gun lockers<br>\u25cf <strong>different ship classes</strong> like capital ships, frigates and multiple smaller fighters<br>\u25cf <strong>five different player classes</strong>, with different weapons and abilities<br>\u25cf complete options menu, with game, graphics and keybinding settings including controller support<br>\u25cf either play on dedicated servers or host your own games in-game<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055610/extras/c313241aa5fe28a78e1a947a9a807550.poster.avif?t=1636128187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055610/extras/c313241aa5fe28a78e1a947a9a807550.webm?t=1636128187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055610/extras/c313241aa5fe28a78e1a947a9a807550.mp4?t=1636128187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
